            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1000-f2" n="93" xml:id="d1000-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to telegram 8195, September 19, 8 p.m., to London, not printed..
                    Concerning the selection of a deputy for Mr. Pauley, see footnote 38, <ref
                        target="#pg1293">p. 1293</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
